It's hugely personality driven. And I think sometimes people, and I think it's understandable to look at things like this and be like, I can't believe this is how decisions are made in our government. Like, really? Like, just because like some guy, like some other guy or whatever, like that's how this happened. But you think about your own workplace, and this is how things happen happen oftentimes in our own workplace,
它在很大程度上是由个性驱动的。而且我认为有时候人们，并且我觉得可以理解，人们看到这样的事情会想：“我简直不敢相信我们政府的决策就是这样做出来的。真的吗？仅仅因为某个家伙，喜欢另一个家伙什么的——事情就是这样发生的？”但你想想你自己的工作场所，我们自己的工作场所里，事情往往也就是这样发生的，

