that when we think about power and someone wants power, there's a kind of an evil feel to that. But in order to accomplish things, you need a certain amount of power and you need to have other people respect your ability to do it and also trust that you can do it. And so what you're saying is like, sometimes you need to be, it's almost like you need to be slightly petty in order to maintain the foundation that allows you to convince other people that they should do things or you can do things. Yeah. Which is unfortunate, I guess, that it can't just be just like sweet wishes and good arguments
每当我们想到权力、当有人渴望权力时，总会有一种邪恶的感觉。但为了把事情办成，你需要一定程度的权力，你需要别人尊重你办事的能耐，同时也得信任你的能力。所以你的意思是，有时你需要——这几乎就像是你需要表现得稍微有一点点小气，才能维系那个基础，从而说服别人配合你，或者证明你能把事情办成。是的。这就有点不幸了，我想，事情不能仅仅靠美好的愿望和精彩的辩论来让别人站在你这一边。我是这样看的，我认为这是一种正确的正义感。

